{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["And the reason for <b>\"and on the seventh day a festival to HaShem\"</b> is that they shall bring their festival offerings on the seventh day, and not delay further, for it has no make-up offering after that. But the first day has a make-up offering throughout all seven days with respect to the matter of the festival offering (Ḥagigah 9a). And both of them are equal with respect to sacred convocation, as they said above (Exodus 12:16), \"and on the first day a sacred convocation, etc., and on the seventh day a sacred convocation,\" etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:07:18.260872946Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}